        "description": "A compilation of Mine' combat gameplay, a look at Survival Hell, and story cutscenes.\n\nMine and Kanda are best buds on a romp through Kamurocho, fighting suspicious men in dark alleys, going wild in photo booths at Sega's arcade, and climbing their way up the Yakuza ladder. \n\nIn this Yakuza 3 Kiwami 3 and Dark Ties compilation are several fights showing off the gameplay mechanics, including those introduced in Like a Dragon Gaiden: The Man Who Erased His Name, such as the wall jump kick attacks. You'll see Mine go into Beast Mode. You'll watch Mine show off his genius tattoos. And you'll experience Mine meeting Chairman Daigo for the first time.\n\nTimestamps:  \n\n00:00 Mine beats up sus men in Kamurocho\n01:09 Mine and Kanda GO WILD at a photo shoot\n01:58 Mine is shirtless\n02:28 Mine meets Chairman Daigo\n03:59 Mine is in Survival Hell\n\n#GameSpot #Yakuza #DarkTides",
